  "description_short": "Popular seafood chain serving fresh fish, sushi and Mediterranean platters in a family-friendly mall setting.",
  "description_long": "Located in the bustling Garden Route Mall, this Ocean Basket branch brings reliable seafood to George's shopping hub. The menu spans grilled linefish, calamari, prawns and sushi platters, alongside Greek-inspired mezze and salads. It's a go-to for families after a mall visit or a quick midweek meal, with generous portions and consistent quality.\n\nThe casual atmosphere suits everyone from toddlers to grandparents, and the open kitchen adds energy to the space. Service is swift during peak shopping hours, making it ideal for a no-fuss lunch or early dinner. While it lacks ocean views, the convenience and familiar menu keep locals coming back for platters piled high with hake, chips and prawns.",
